      "text": "Since Christmas Day and New Year's Day fall on a Monday this year, it is my desire that all personnel in your office be given a holiday on Saturday, December 23rd and Saturday, December 30th. This shall apply to all personnel, except those necessary for the proper protection of life, health and property.",
